      "title": "AllCrypt attack on February 10th caused OMC auction cancellation, mining suspension, and disabling of 3P1C/OMC awards",
      "description": "An attacker made ~3 million OMC worth of deposits on AllCrypt and sold them off, withdrawing at least 2 BTC. AllCrypt was short ~2.5 million OMC. The OMC Dev Team shut down all mining pools. Omniscient cancelled the official group OMC auction and disabled 3P1C upgrades and the OMC award. He remained optimistic about recovery within a week or two.",
